    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "After Yugi Muto's victory over Marik, Yugi collected all three Egyptian God cards. However, they would not remain in his possession for long."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Panic ensued as real monsters appeared all over the world. Worse still, Yugi's Egyptian God Cards were stolen by three unknown assailants."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "solomonmuto",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Nooo! How... can this... have happened?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Grandpa! Are you all right?"
    },
    {
      "char": "solomonmuto",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Yugi... They're gone..."
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Who's gone, Grandpa!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "solomonmuto",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Your cards... Your strongest cards..."
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "The God Cards!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "LEFT_BACK",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Who did dis!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "solomonmuto",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "classic_gamestore",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Yugi and his friends were at a loss on who could've stolen the cards when a package arrived in the mail."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "solomonmuto",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Hey kids, this came in the mail."
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Who's it from?"
    },
    {
      "char": "solomonmuto",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "I'm not sure. My eyesight's not what it used to be."
    },
    {
      "char": "teagardner",
      "pos": "RIGHT_FRONT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Let's see here... From the office of Maximillion Pegasus."
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "LEFT_FRONT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "No! Not Pegasus!"
    },
    {
      "char": "solomonmuto",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "teagardner",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "What should we do?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "CENTER:FADEIN",
      "image": "",
      "text": "We should hear what he has to say. After all, Pegasus did invent Duel Monsters."
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "CENTER:FADEIN",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "And you think he has something to do with what's been going on?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "CENTER:FADEIN",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Perhaps. Let’s play the tape."
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "dlc_ind_illusions",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "maximillionpegasus",
      "pos": "CENTER:FADEIN",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Greetings, Yugi boy. I'm sure you're aware that Duel Monsters are suddenly running amok all around this world of ours. I know who's really behind this. The only catch is, it's too risky to leave you any information on this tape. So that means you'll have to come see me in person."
    },
    {
      "char": "maximillionpegasus",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "classic_gamestore",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "CENTER:FADEIN",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Say what!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "There's no way we can trust that guy!"
    },
    {
      "char": "teagardner",
      "pos": "LEFT_FRONT",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "What do you think, Yugi?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Let's go. Pegasus may be our only hope."
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "FADEOUT",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "FADEIN:CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "That's true... All right then! I'm going."
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "LEFT_FRONT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Then I’ll be right there by your side, pal!"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "LEFT_BACK",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "teagardner",
      "pos": "LEFT_FRONT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Count me in too!"
    },
    {
      "char": "tristantaylor",
      "pos": "RIGHT_BACK",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Me too! He is flying us there first class, right?"
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "smile",
      "text": "Thanks guys!"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "teagardner",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "tristantaylor",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yugimuto",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "dlc_temple",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Back in their ancient lair, the three card robbers – Rafael, Alister, and Valon – met with their master, Dartz."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rafael",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "We located the Pharaoh, Master. Unfortunately, we weren't able to capture his soul. But I never come back empty-handed. I present these cards to you."
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_ON",
      "image": "classic_egyptiangodcards",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "dartz",
      "pos": "LEFT",
      "image": "happy",
      "text": "Excellent. The Egyptian Gods. At long last, I finally possess the supreme force necessary to awaken the great beast! The time has arrived, my friends. Finally after 10,000 years, the great Leviathan shall arise again!"
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_OFF",
      "image": "classic_egyptiangodcards",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "dartz",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Once I replenish you with enough souls, you shall inherit the strength to swallow the earth! No one will stop us! No one!"
    },
    {
      "char": "rafael",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "I'll find the Pharaoh. And this time, I'll make sure we drain his power to feed the great beast, sir."
    },
    {
      "char": "dartz",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "",
      "text": "Why don't you try listening? It's really a wonderful skill. If you master it, you'll realize that we need more than the Pharaoh's soul!"
    },
    {
      "char": "alister",
      "pos": "LEFT_FRONT",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "Then we'll deal with the others, too! I'll take Kaiba!"
    },
    {
      "char": "valon",
      "pos": "RIGHT_FRONT",
      "image": "happy",
      "text": "I also got my eye on someone. That feisty little bloke, Joey Wheeler! He should be fun ta take apart."
    },
    {
      "char": "dartz",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "neutral",
      "text": "The Pharaoh and his friends are on their way to speak with the one we've been watching. Just make certain that you reach him before they do."
    },
    {
      "char": "rafael",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Pegasus?"
    },
    {
      "char": "dartz",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "And to think I called you a bad listener. Now go see Pegasus at once."
    },
    {
      "char": "dartz",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "rafael",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "alister",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "valon",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "BG",
      "image": "dlc_ind_illusions",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "CENTER",
      "image": "",
      "text": "When Yugi and his friends arrived at Industrial Illusions, they were not greeted by Pegasus, but rather another familiar face."
    },
    {
      "char": "infn8",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "tristantaylor",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Hellooo? Pegasus!? The place is completely empty!"
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "I suspect the thieves that were after Pegasus may have already found him. And if that's the case, I'm sure they're expecting us."
    },
    {
      "char": "tristantaylor",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "RIGHT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Mai? Is dat you?"
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "LEFT:FRONT",
      "image": "alternate_neutral",
      "text": "I'm not Mai. At least not the Mai you knew."
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "What?"
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "alternate_happy1",
      "text": "You heard me. Alright gang, say hello to Pegasus!"
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_ON",
      "image": "classic_seal_pegasus",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "teagardner",
      "pos": "RIGHT_FRONT",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Uh, question: Did you do that ta him!?"
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_OFF",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "anger",
      "text": "Look! You betta start talkin'!"
    },
    {
      "char": "valon",
      "pos": "LEFT:FRONT",
      "image": "",
      "text": "What's ‘a matter, Wheeler? Did your little reunion with Mai not go as well as you expected it to? And you! Why are you keepin' these guys all for yourself, Mai?"
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "alternate_anger",
      "text": "Mind your own business, you lackey. These geeks are mine, so deal with it!"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "sad",
      "text": "Geeks? But we’re your friends, Mai! Please Mai, tell me this is all a joke! You're on our side, remember?"
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "alternate_neutral",
      "text": "I was never a part of your little playgroup. And now I'm gonna break you apart, one-by-one! And Wheeler... I'm starting with you!"
    },
    {
      "char": "valon",
      "pos": "NONE",
      "image": "",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "alternate_happy1",
      "text": "You were holding me back from achieving true power! So say hello to my real friend! The Seal of Orichalcos!"
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_ON",
      "image": "classic_seal",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "char": "yamiyugi",
      "pos": "RIGHT_FRONT",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Oh no! Not this!"
    },
    {
      "char": "joeywheeler",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "surprise",
      "text": "Mai, let's talk. There's gotta be another way ta settle dis."
    },
    {
      "char": "maivalentine",
      "pos": "",
      "image": "alternate_neutral",
      "text": "Sorry, hun! Whoever loses the duel... loses their soul!"
    },
    {
      "char": "command",
      "pos": "PROP_OFF",
      "image": "classic_seal",
      "text": ""
    }
  ]
}
